        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-4">Table of Contents</h3>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-sm text-text-muted">
          <li><a href="#sec-1" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">1. Quick Comparison</a></li>
          <li><a href="#sec-2" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">2. How We Tested</a></li>
          <li><a href="#sec-3" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">3. Top Picks</a></li>
