        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="prose-content text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary" data-aos="fade-up"><h2 id="sec-1">Quick Comparison</h2><p>Cordless vacuums have come a long way, and lightweight models under 7 pounds now deliver suction rivaling corded units. We tested 15 models across suction power, battery life, weight distribution, and versatility.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Product</th><th>Price</th><th>Rating</th><th>Weight</th><th>Battery</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Dyson V15 Detect</strong></td><td>$749</td><td>⭐ 4.9/5</td><td>6.8 lbs</td><td>60 min</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Dyson V10</strong></td><td>$469</td><td>⭐ 4.7/5</td><td>5.8 lbs</td><td>60 min</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Shark Stratos</strong></td><td>$399</td><td>⭐ 4.6/5</td><td>7.5 lbs</td><td>50 min</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Tineco Pure ONE S12</strong></td><td>$329</td><td>⭐ 4.5/5</td><td>5.5 lbs</td><td>45 min</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Miele Triflex HX2</strong></td><td>$549</td><td>⭐ 4.6/5</td><td>7.3 lbs</td><td>60 min</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Bissell CrossWave Pet</strong></td><td>$249</td><td>⭐ 4.3/5</td><td>10.5 lbs</td><td>30 min</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><strong>Leevy D50 Pro</strong></td><td>$199</td><td>⭐ 4.2/5</td><td>4.4 lbs</td><td>40 min</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td><strong>Cleanview Rechargeable</strong></td><td>$129</td><td>⭐ 4.0/5</td><td>5.0 lbs</td><td>35 min</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td><strong>Hoover ONEPWR Evolve</strong></td><td>$179</td><td>⭐ 4.1/5</td><td>5.6 lbs</td><td>35 min</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td><strong>Workpro W001</strong></td><td>$89</td><td>⭐ 3.9/5</td><td>4.2 lbs</td><td>25 min</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="sec-2">How We Tested</h2><p>Standardized testing on multiple surfaces: suction with calibrated airflow meters, battery runtime on medium power, weight comfort during 30-minute sessions, attachment versatility, dustbin emptying ease, and noise at 3 feet.</p><h2 id="sec-3">Top Picks Reviewed</h2><h3>1. Dyson V15 Detect — Best Overall</h3><p>Laser illumination reveals microscopic dust. Piezo sensor auto-adjusts suction. LCD displays real-time particle count. At 6.8 lbs with 60-min battery, it covers most homes. The hair screw tool prevents tangles for pet owners.</p><div style="background:#F7F4EF;border-left:3px solid #C9A962;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin:1.5rem 0;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-size:0.95rem"><strong>Best for:</strong> Whole-home cleaning, pet owners, and anyone wanting the most advanced technology.</p></div><h3>2. Dyson V10 — Best Value</h3><p>At $469, delivers 90% of V15 performance. Digital Motorbar adapts suction automatically. 60-minute battery identical to V15. Missing laser and LCD but essential for most users.</p><h3>3. Shark Stratos — Best Multi-Surface</h3><p>DuoClean with soft roller for hard floors and motorized brush for carpets. Self-cleaning brushroll prevents hair wrap. At $399, it undercuts the Dyson V10 with comparable performance.</p><h2 id="sec-4">Buying Guide</h2><p><strong>Weight:</strong> Under 6 lbs for one-handed comfort. <strong>Battery:</strong> 40+ min for apartments, 50+ min for larger homes. <strong>Wall mount:</strong> Models with charging docks keep you always ready.</p><h2 id="sec-5">FAQs</h2><h3>How long do batteries last?</h3><p>3-5 years with regular use. Replacement batteries cost $40-80. Dyson and Shark rate for 500+ charge cycles.</p><h3>Can they replace corded vacuums?</h3><p>For homes under 2,000 sq ft, yes. The Dyson V15 and V10 clean entire homes on one charge. For larger spaces, corded may still be preferable.</p><h2 id="sec-6">Final Verdict</h2><div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1A1A1A 0%,#2A2A2A 100%);color:white;padding:2rem;border-radius:12px;margin-top:2rem"><p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 0.75rem 0;color:#C9A962">Our Recommendation</p><p style="margin:0;line-height:1.8">The <strong>Dyson V15 Detect</strong> at $749 is unmatched. For most buyers, the <strong>Dyson V10</strong> at $469 offers the best balance. Budget shoppers should consider the <strong>Leevy D50 Pro</strong> at $199.</p></div></div>
      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-border flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
